step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test the best single model hypothesis by selecting ARIMA alone to see if a single strong model beats the robust median ensemble.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ARIMA"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean over the full pool to see if trimming improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","models":["ARIMA","THETA","rf","CWT_catboost","NaiveMovingAverage","CWT_rf","CWT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_rf","ONLY_FT_rf"],"trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a median combination over the most stable pool (pool1) to see if restricting to top 5 models improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over the most stable pool (pool4) to see if restricting to the 8 most consistent models improves performance.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a robust median over pool2 to see if a smaller, more stable subset improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the more stable pool3 to see if it improves over the baseline median of full pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean over the full 19‑model pool to see if trimming improves robustness beyond the existing trimmed‑mean on pool4.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a robust median over the reduced pool4 to see if trimming the pool improves stability.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Try a DTW barycenter (dba) over pool1 to see if a more sophisticated aggregation beats median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a dba strategy on pool2 to see if a larger pool improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test DBA on pool3 to see if a different pool improves the robust barycenter performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse-error weighting on the full model pool to see if error‑based weighting improves over the robust median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

